    {
      "slide_number": 2,
      "title": "A promising opportunity is meaningful, evidenced, and addressable.",
      "text_boxes": [],
      "bullet_points": [],
      "notes": "",
      "tables": [],
      "images": [],
      "shapes_count": 18
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 3,
      "title": "Exit with one evidence-backed opportunity and a next experiment.",
      "text_boxes": [],
      "bullet_points": [],
      "notes": "",
      "tables": [],
      "images": [],
      "shapes_count": 22
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 4,
      "title": "Opportunity is a hypothesis about value—not proof of impact or market.",
      "text_boxes": [],
      "bullet_points": [],
      "notes": "",
      "tables": [],
      "images": [],
      "shapes_count": 18
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 5,
      "title": "Interviews reveal meaning. Observation reveals behavior. Prototypes reveal reactions.",
      "text_boxes": [],
      "bullet_points": [],
      "notes": "",
      "tables": [],
      "images": [],
      "shapes_count": 22
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 6,
      "title": "Mark notes observed, reported, or inferred. Contradictions are useful clues.",
      "text_boxes": [],
      "bullet_points": [],
      "notes": "",
      "tables": [],
      "images": [],
      "shapes_count": 22
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 7,
      "title": "Avoid leading questions, pitching, and treating “would you?” as proof.",
      "text_boxes": [],
      "bullet_points": [],
      "notes": "",
      "tables": [],
      "images": [],
      "shapes_count": 22
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 8,
      "title": "Separate “I saw…” from “I think…”. Return interpretations for a sense-check.",
      "text_boxes": [],
      "bullet_points": [],
      "notes": "",
      "tables": [],
      "images": [],
      "shapes_count": 18
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 9,
      "title": "Weak: “Users need an app.” Strong: explain the user, need, and evidence.",
      "text_boxes": [],
      "bullet_points": [],
      "notes": "",
      "tables": [],
      "images": [],
      "shapes_count": 18
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 10,
      "title": "A vivid story is not prevalence. Qualitative explains; suitable quantitative data estimates frequency.",
      "text_boxes": [],
      "bullet_points": [],
      "notes": "",
      "tables": [],
      "images": [],
      "shapes_count": 18
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 11,
      "title": "A persona is a research summary—not a fictional character.",
      "text_boxes": [],
      "bullet_points": [],
      "notes": "",
      "tables": [],
      "images": [],
      "shapes_count": 22
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 12,
      "title": "Define success from the user perspective before building.",
      "text_boxes": [],
      "bullet_points": [],
      "notes": "",
      "tables": [],
      "images": [],
      "shapes_count": 18
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 13,
      "title": "Triangulation builds confidence; conflicting signals call for investigation.",
      "text_boxes": [],
      "bullet_points": [],
      "notes": "",
      "tables": [],
      "images": [],
      "shapes_count": 22
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 14,
      "title": "A MUP tests an assumption; it is not a finished product.",
      "text_boxes": [],
      "bullet_points": [],
      "notes": "",
      "tables": [],
      "images": [],
      "shapes_count": 18
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 15,
      "title": "Value proposition remains a hypothesis until real behavior supports it.",
      "text_boxes": [],
      "bullet_points": [],
      "notes": "",
      "tables": [],
      "images": [],
      "shapes_count": 18
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 16,
      "title": "Connect each feature to a real job, pain, or gain—and test the link.",
      "text_boxes": [],
      "bullet_points": [],
      "notes": "",
      "tables": [],
      "images": [],
      "shapes_count": 18
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 17,
      "title": "Compare on user value, evidence, feasibility, and unintended effects.",
      "text_boxes": [],
      "bullet_points": [],
      "notes": "",
      "tables": [],
      "images": [],
      "shapes_count": 18
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 18,
      "title": "Opportunity may lie in a relationship or handoff—not a single component.",
      "text_boxes": [],
      "bullet_points": [],
      "notes": "",
      "tables": [],
      "images": [],
      "shapes_count": 18
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 19,
      "title": "Deliverable: target user + evidenced need + opportunity statement + next test.",
      "text_boxes": [],
      "bullet_points": [],
      "notes": "",
      "tables": [],
      "images": [],
      "shapes_count": 22
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 20,
      "title": "Next action: collect evidence from one person in the target context before proposing a solution.",
      "text_boxes": [],
      "bullet_points": [],
      "notes": "",
